{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37443","headline":"秋霁夜吟寄友人 · 唐彦谦","name":"秋霁夜吟寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槐柳萧疎溽暑收，金商频伏火西流。\n尘衣岁晚缘身贱，雨簟更深满背秋。\n前事悲凉何足道，远书慵懒未能修。\n惟思待月高梧下，更就东牀访惠休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}